1
00:01:41,740 --> 00:01:49,020
[Genius Girlfriend]

2
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:51,960
[Episode 24]

3
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:21,150
It's alright.

4
00:02:22,090 --> 00:02:23,490
It doesn't hurt anymore.

5
00:02:23,750 --> 00:02:24,560
Look.

6
00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:26,030
I can walk fast.

7
00:02:27,870 --> 00:02:30,270
Jiang Yubai, thanks for your premium care.

8
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:34,510
I can finally walk by myself.

9
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:42,190
Bone injuries take a long time to heal.

10
00:02:42,190 --> 00:02:43,360
Don't push yourself.

11
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,590
You need to fully recover.

12
00:02:44,590 --> 00:02:46,470
Don't leave a root cause of trouble
for the rest of your life.

13
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:47,520
No problem.

14
00:02:47,590 --> 00:02:49,560
Look, it doesn't hurt at all.

15
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,190
Alright.

16
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:56,750
Then...

17
00:02:58,750 --> 00:03:00,080
my mission is over too.

18
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,080
I should pack up

19
00:03:03,630 --> 00:03:04,890
and go back to my place.

20
00:03:16,070 --> 00:03:16,870
Jiang Yubai.

21
00:03:22,190 --> 00:03:23,000
It's quite

22
00:03:23,430 --> 00:03:25,910
spacious here for the two of us.

23
00:03:26,710 --> 00:03:29,280
And it's quite close to your workshop.

24
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:30,630
How about...

25
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,710
Actually, I also...

26
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:48,120
Brother, why are you here?

27
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,280
Might as well throw your phone away
if you're not gonna use it.

28
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:51,079
You didn't reply to my messages.

29
00:03:52,290 --> 00:03:53,650
Why are you still here?

30
00:03:54,030 --> 00:03:55,710
We were just discussing

31
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:58,470
whether he could stay at my place
for a few more days.

32
00:03:58,470 --> 00:03:59,240
Stay?

33
00:04:01,930 --> 00:04:04,190
Just to look after each other.

34
00:04:08,910 --> 00:04:09,840
You stayed here?

35
00:04:11,030 --> 00:04:12,290
No, Brother, I just...

36
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,280
slept on the floor here.

37
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,130
You slept on the floor here?

38
00:04:22,270 --> 00:04:23,600
What were you thinking?

39
00:04:26,070 --> 00:04:27,600
And what were you thinking?

40
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:30,160
Didn't I tell you to message me?

41
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,420
Where's the location?

42
00:04:32,260 --> 00:04:33,350
You located here?

43
00:04:34,350 --> 00:04:37,920
-Brother, I just want to take care of her.
-Okay, I got it.

44
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:39,480
Come, thanks for looking after her
these 2 days.

45
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,070
You should go.

46
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:41,600
Brother, it's not what you think.

47
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,750
Don't call me Brother.
I'm not your brother. Leave.

48
00:04:43,750 --> 00:04:44,870
It's not what you think.

49
00:04:44,870 --> 00:04:45,360
Leave.

50
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,830
I asked for his help, Brother.

51
00:04:46,830 --> 00:04:47,870
-Wait.
-Just leave.

52
00:04:47,870 --> 00:04:49,630
Wait, Brother, listen to me...

53
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:51,510
I'll message you, Jiang Yubai!

54
00:04:52,070 --> 00:04:53,680
Message? Huh?

55
00:04:57,980 --> 00:05:00,420
One, 2, 3, 4, 5,

56
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,950
6, 7, 8, 9, 10,

57
00:05:02,950 --> 00:05:05,040
11, 12, 13, 14,

58
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,510
15, 16, 17,

59
00:05:06,510 --> 00:05:07,830
18, 19.

60
00:05:17,510 --> 00:05:18,310
Dr. Shen,

61
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,480
look.

62
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,330
There are already 20 stickers,

63
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:23,290
and they are all different fruits.

64
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,480
Are there 20?

65
00:05:25,190 --> 00:05:26,480
Making a false report again.

66
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,680
How is that possible?

67
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,980
I've counted them several times.

68
00:05:30,190 --> 00:05:31,480
One, 2, 3, 4, 5,

69
00:05:31,510 --> 00:05:32,540
6, 7...

70
00:05:35,070 --> 00:05:35,830
I'm kidding.

71
00:05:38,190 --> 00:05:40,120
Dr. Shen, you've turned bad.

72
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:42,920
Tell me,

73
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:44,870
what is your wish?

74
00:05:49,630 --> 00:05:50,560
I want to go out.

75
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,000
Shui,

76
00:06:04,180 --> 00:06:06,980
although you've been
very cooperative recently,

77
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,560
your physical indicators

78
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,070
are still not ideal.

79
00:06:11,070 --> 00:06:12,630
I won't go far.

80
00:06:14,830 --> 00:06:15,630
For one day.

81
00:06:15,950 --> 00:06:16,920
Just one day.

82
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:20,080
I'll take my medicine on time.

83
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:21,870
I just want

84
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:25,190
to bask in the sun

85
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,760
and feel the breeze outside.

86
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,810
I want to breathe the air

87
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:33,159
without the smell of disinfectant.

88
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:48,070
I'll apply for it.

89
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,480
Really?

90
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,800
But we have to make some rules first.

91
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:59,159
You must follow my arrangements
when you go out.

92
00:06:59,159 --> 00:07:00,600
Don't leave my sight.

93
00:07:00,830 --> 00:07:02,310
If you feel unwell,

94
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:04,020
you must tell me immediately.

95
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:08,600
If I find out you hid anything...

96
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:10,530
You can punish me however you want.

97
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:12,600
I promise.

98
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,640
Even 100 rules would be fine.

99
00:07:18,060 --> 00:07:20,410
[DOLA FOTO] [Capture Your Beauty]

100
00:07:19,630 --> 00:07:21,290
I want to use this photo booth.

101
00:07:26,430 --> 00:07:28,190
Three, two, one.

102
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,659
The weather is really nice today.

103
00:08:47,550 --> 00:08:49,390
The sun feels so comfortable.

104
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,510
I thought

105
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,800
when you asked me to take you out,

106
00:08:56,030 --> 00:08:58,090
you'd want to do something exciting.

107
00:08:59,910 --> 00:09:00,770
I didn't expect

108
00:09:02,790 --> 00:09:04,320
your wish to be so ordinary.

109
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:08,020
It's not ordinary.

110
00:09:09,550 --> 00:09:11,680
I've dreamed of having a day like this.

111
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,400
How could it be ordinary?

112
00:09:23,030 --> 00:09:23,510
Shui.

113
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,730
About what I mentioned before,

114
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:32,330
the experimental therapy abroad...

115
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,660
Have you thought about it?

116
00:09:50,790 --> 00:09:52,720
The success rate of the experiment

117
00:09:52,790 --> 00:09:54,190
isn't high to begin with.

118
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,960
So no matter what you choose,

119
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,080
I understand you

120
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,040
and will support you.

121
00:11:39,630 --> 00:11:40,440
Dr. Shen.

122
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,840
I accept that treatment.

123
00:12:43,490 --> 00:12:47,390
[Lin Zhixia]

124
00:12:45,510 --> 00:12:46,570
What are you doing?

125
00:12:47,670 --> 00:12:53,830
[Jiang Yubai]

126
00:12:53,910 --> 00:13:01,170
[Read papers. What about you?]

127
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,720
Reading papers. What about you?

128
00:13:01,170 --> 00:13:07,810
[Working.]

129
00:13:09,010 --> 00:13:10,270
Don't find it a hassle.

130
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:12,530
Make sure to use
the anti-slip mat in the bathroom.

131
00:13:12,530 --> 00:13:14,700
Remember to heat up the milk
before drinking it at night.

132
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:15,830
Don't drink it cold.

133
00:13:22,370 --> 00:13:22,900
Okay,

134
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:23,550
got it.

135
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,980
Don't stay up too late either.

136
00:13:42,680 --> 00:13:43,620
This weekend,

137
00:13:44,700 --> 00:13:45,460
are you free?

138
00:13:52,250 --> 00:13:52,840
Yes.

139
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:59,460
Then let's hang out this weekend.

140
00:14:09,620 --> 00:14:11,050
Okay, it's a date.

141
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:21,820
[Search Stickers] [Pinky swear]

142
00:14:21,850 --> 00:14:24,250
[Sending]

143
00:14:24,470 --> 00:14:27,410
[Okay, it's a date.]

144
00:14:35,030 --> 00:14:39,450
♪ I'm like the gentle clouds in the sky ♪

145
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:44,270
♪ Looking forward
to the stop of the night breeze ♪

146
00:14:45,890 --> 00:14:52,470
♪ I'm wandering about carefully,
looking for the answer, so at a loss ♪

147
00:14:56,450 --> 00:15:00,810
♪ Sometimes I wonder
if I should back down ♪

148
00:15:01,790 --> 00:15:05,850
♪ Sudden alienation between us
is what scares me the most ♪

149
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:11,380
♪ How can two hearts beat as one
and truly feel each other? ♪

150
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:12,870
Xu Nuo.

151
00:15:13,390 --> 00:15:14,200
-Xu Nuo.
-Xu Nuo.

152
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:15,600
Xu Nuo, can you open the door?

153
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,630
Xu Nuo, open the door.

154
00:15:16,630 --> 00:15:17,320
Xu Nuo!

155
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,030
What should we do?

156
00:15:19,030 --> 00:15:20,960
Xu Nuo, Xu Nuo, can you hear me?
Open the door.

157
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:21,720
Dr. Lin.

158
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,790
-Dr. Lin, you're here.
-Dr. Lin.

159
00:15:23,790 --> 00:15:25,320
I heard something happened to Xu Nuo.

160
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:27,030
Senior Tan isn't at school,
so I came to check.

161
00:15:27,030 --> 00:15:27,790
I don't know what happened.

162
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:28,870
Xu Nuo locked herself inside.

163
00:15:28,870 --> 00:15:30,000
She won't answer the door for anyone.

164
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:30,910
Where is the key?

165
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:31,600
We...

166
00:15:31,860 --> 00:15:33,870
we don't have Professor Wu's signature,

167
00:15:33,870 --> 00:15:35,330
so we didn't dare to use it.

168
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,390
I'll take the blame if anything happens.

169
00:15:38,390 --> 00:15:39,750
I'll get the professor to sign later.

170
00:15:39,750 --> 00:15:40,720
Go get the key.

171
00:15:40,910 --> 00:15:41,750
Okay.

172
00:15:48,740 --> 00:15:50,820
Get out! All of you, get out!

173
00:15:53,390 --> 00:15:55,000
It's fine. You can go back first.

174
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:55,930
Leave this to me.

175
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:16,960
It's me.

176
00:16:22,030 --> 00:16:23,150
Senior Lin.

177
00:16:24,910 --> 00:16:26,510
I was afraid you were
under too much pressure,

178
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:27,570
so I came to see you.

179
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:30,440
I messed up.

180
00:16:31,910 --> 00:16:33,550
I completely messed up.

181
00:16:36,220 --> 00:16:38,930
I don't even know
if the data can be recovered.

182
00:16:39,910 --> 00:16:42,040
I'm definitely getting disciplined.

183
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,960
I know exactly what I'm capable of.

184
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:49,510
I can't carry such a heavy burden.

185
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:54,750
Even Senior Luo Ying
would find it a bit tough.

186
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,910
Then she went to your team.

187
00:16:56,910 --> 00:16:58,460
There was really no one else.

188
00:16:58,460 --> 00:17:01,260
So Senior Tan made me fill in temporarily.

189
00:17:02,460 --> 00:17:03,960
Coordinating team members.

190
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:05,359
Steering the direction.

191
00:17:05,510 --> 00:17:06,950
Dealing with reviews.

192
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:10,160
And verifying everyone's data.

193
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:12,460
I really don't have that much energy.

194
00:17:13,180 --> 00:17:14,359
I'm so tired.

195
00:17:32,940 --> 00:17:33,800
Stop knocking!

196
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:35,620
[School of Mathematical Sciences
Experimental Center, Qingbei University]

197
00:17:40,330 --> 00:17:41,730
-Senior Tan.
-What's up?

198
00:17:44,010 --> 00:17:46,850
Senior, neither your team nor mine

199
00:17:46,870 --> 00:17:49,400
has anyone who can lead
a team independently.

200
00:17:50,420 --> 00:17:53,350
And your project schedule
is even tighter than mine.

201
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:55,290
I know.

202
00:17:56,050 --> 00:17:57,650
I don't need you to remind me.

203
00:17:58,010 --> 00:17:59,220
If there's nothing else, please leave.

204
00:17:59,220 --> 00:18:00,140
I need to work.

205
00:18:00,480 --> 00:18:01,400
I can help.

206
00:18:03,940 --> 00:18:04,870
What do you mean?

207
00:18:06,420 --> 00:18:08,920
The data processing and model construction
you're worrying about

208
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:10,080
are what I'm good at.

209
00:18:10,290 --> 00:18:11,140
I can help.

210
00:18:18,740 --> 00:18:19,530
Lin Zhixia.

211
00:18:20,220 --> 00:18:21,820
Given my current situation,

212
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:23,650
shouldn't you be the happiest?

213
00:18:25,110 --> 00:18:26,030
I don't need you here

214
00:18:26,030 --> 00:18:27,240
playing the saint.

215
00:18:27,770 --> 00:18:29,660
All the resources you want in the future

216
00:18:29,660 --> 00:18:30,740
will flow to you.

217
00:18:31,290 --> 00:18:32,810
Stop talking nonsense.

218
00:18:33,140 --> 00:18:34,540
Do you need my help or not?

219
00:18:34,900 --> 00:18:36,530
If you do, I'll stay and help.

220
00:18:36,530 --> 00:18:37,290
If not,

221
00:18:37,290 --> 00:18:38,490
I'll go do my own work.

222
00:18:49,420 --> 00:18:50,010
Yes.

223
00:18:52,500 --> 00:18:53,250
Half an hour.

224
00:18:53,850 --> 00:18:55,530
I'll go back to my team
and arrange things first.

225
00:18:55,530 --> 00:18:58,010
Organize all the previous data
and materials.

226
00:18:58,010 --> 00:18:58,940
In half an hour,

227
00:18:59,090 --> 00:19:01,220
I'll see you at the supercomputer lab.

228
00:19:02,850 --> 00:19:03,530
Let's go.

229
00:19:04,570 --> 00:19:05,380
See?

230
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:06,740
I told you long ago

231
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:09,590
she is completely different from you.

232
00:19:10,050 --> 00:19:11,980
Don't act as if you know her so well.

233
00:19:12,310 --> 00:19:16,890
[School of Mathematical Sciences
Experimental Center, Qingbei University]

234
00:19:30,460 --> 00:19:32,090
You've changed your hairstyle.

235
00:19:32,090 --> 00:19:33,350
Looks quite youthful.

236
00:19:46,460 --> 00:19:47,180
Peng,

237
00:19:47,660 --> 00:19:48,700
here is the money for this month.

238
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:49,530
Count it.

239
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:56,460
Not bad, kid.

240
00:19:58,050 --> 00:19:59,650
The amount is exactly right.

241
00:19:59,660 --> 00:20:00,940
And you're even early.

242
00:20:03,220 --> 00:20:05,250
You look like you're doing well lately.

243
00:20:05,250 --> 00:20:06,780
Did something good happen?

244
00:20:07,810 --> 00:20:09,740
Are you getting out of this misery?

245
00:20:12,290 --> 00:20:13,490
You're joking, Peng.

246
00:20:14,090 --> 00:20:15,810
I gave it to you early since I had enough.

247
00:20:15,810 --> 00:20:17,470
It gives us both peace of mind.

248
00:20:18,250 --> 00:20:20,110
Next month will be the usual time.

249
00:20:21,090 --> 00:20:23,090
Alright, you're straightforward,

250
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:24,240
and I'm easygoing.

251
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:26,630
I'm leaving.

252
00:20:33,090 --> 00:20:33,850
Tingting.

253
00:20:33,170 --> 00:20:41,620
[Star Shine Media]

254
00:20:33,980 --> 00:20:35,660
I watched Su Mo's variety show last night.

255
00:20:35,660 --> 00:20:37,250
I didn't expect him
to react so quickly on the spot.

256
00:20:37,250 --> 00:20:38,740
There were a few moments
I was worried would be awkward,

257
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:40,160
but he saved it with just one sentence.

258
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:41,550
He did okay yesterday.

259
00:20:41,790 --> 00:20:42,810
Congratulations, Tingting.

260
00:20:42,810 --> 00:20:44,120
The trailer
for "Deep Alley and Long Night"

261
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:45,530
was all over my Moments last night.

262
00:20:45,530 --> 00:20:46,570
Everyone is looking forward to it.

263
00:20:46,570 --> 00:20:47,700
You have a good eye,

264
00:20:47,700 --> 00:20:49,570
choosing such a good project for Su Mo.

265
00:20:49,570 --> 00:20:52,030
I look forward to Mo outshining the leads.

266
00:20:52,250 --> 00:20:53,500
He can't, really.

267
00:20:53,530 --> 00:20:55,050
Su Mo is still a newcomer.

268
00:20:55,050 --> 00:20:56,980
It's better to take things
one step at a time.

269
00:20:56,980 --> 00:20:59,380
Thank you, everyone.
I'm treating you to milk tea today.

270
00:20:59,380 --> 00:21:01,910
-Thank you, Tingting!
-Thank you, Tingting!

271
00:21:06,610 --> 00:21:07,420
Tingting,

272
00:21:07,500 --> 00:21:09,180
the brand just sent 2 more contracts,

273
00:21:09,180 --> 00:21:10,180
specifically asking for Su Mo.

274
00:21:10,180 --> 00:21:11,900
I organized them
and put them on your desk.

275
00:21:11,900 --> 00:21:12,610
Thank you.

276
00:21:17,350 --> 00:21:19,720
[Department Manager's Office]

277
00:21:54,630 --> 00:21:57,710
[Class Break]

278
00:21:57,420 --> 00:21:58,090
Friends,

279
00:21:58,090 --> 00:21:59,550
my boy has made an achievement.

280
00:21:59,550 --> 00:22:01,200
Please help like and share.

281
00:22:01,270 --> 00:22:03,530
I've even prepared the pictures for you.

282
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:09,570
Awesome, Tingting!

283
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:10,980
You've worked hard too.

284
00:22:10,980 --> 00:22:12,770
Congratulations.
I don't know what it means,

285
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:14,370
[Congratulations]

286
00:22:12,770 --> 00:22:13,530
but I've shared it.

287
00:22:13,530 --> 00:22:14,720
Congratulations.

288
00:22:14,370 --> 00:22:16,470
[Wow, for someone,
work comes before everything.]

289
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:17,310
For someone, work comes before everything.

290
00:22:16,490 --> 00:22:20,370
[Congratulations, Agent Tang.]

291
00:22:17,480 --> 00:22:19,210
Congratulations, Agent Tang.

292
00:22:25,520 --> 00:22:29,150
[Duan Qiyan]

293
00:22:25,900 --> 00:22:27,510
Duan, you took shots at me
in the group chat.

294
00:22:27,510 --> 00:22:28,460
Are you jealous?

295
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:31,610
What?

296
00:22:33,420 --> 00:22:35,530
I said you talk too much nonsense.

297
00:22:36,180 --> 00:22:38,650
I'm treating you to dinner tonight.

298
00:22:38,670 --> 00:22:40,250
I'll give you a chance
to take shots at me.

299
00:22:40,250 --> 00:22:40,980
How about it?

300
00:22:40,980 --> 00:22:42,040
You pick the place.

301
00:22:43,530 --> 00:22:46,000
Sure, I'll eat you out of house and home.

302
00:22:44,150 --> 00:22:46,380
[Well, sure, I'll eat you out of house
and home. I'll send you the location.]

303
00:22:46,090 --> 00:22:47,620
I'll send you the location.

304
00:23:24,290 --> 00:23:25,250
You have to tell me.

305
00:23:25,250 --> 00:23:26,850
I really want to recreate it.

306
00:23:27,500 --> 00:23:28,140
No.

307
00:23:29,050 --> 00:23:30,030
I'm not opening a noodle shop.

308
00:23:30,030 --> 00:23:30,850
Just tell me.

309
00:23:33,420 --> 00:23:35,530
Tang, why are you so late?

310
00:23:35,660 --> 00:23:37,750
I've been waiting so long
I'm full from drinking water.

311
00:23:37,750 --> 00:23:39,220
If you still didn't show up,

312
00:23:39,220 --> 00:23:41,350
I would have barged into your company.

313
00:23:43,380 --> 00:23:44,580
Let me introduce you.

314
00:23:44,660 --> 00:23:45,500
Yuanyuan,

315
00:23:45,740 --> 00:23:47,250
the owner of this shop.

316
00:23:47,380 --> 00:23:49,660
Tang, my childhood friend.

317
00:23:50,050 --> 00:23:50,850
Hello.

318
00:23:52,870 --> 00:23:53,580
Hello.

319
00:23:55,980 --> 00:23:58,510
Come and sit.
Why are you just standing there?

320
00:24:00,900 --> 00:24:01,660
Tang!

321
00:24:03,380 --> 00:24:04,540
Wait a minute!

322
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:06,140
Tang!

323
00:24:06,460 --> 00:24:07,920
Tang, where are you going?

324
00:24:08,940 --> 00:24:09,810
Duan Qiyan,

325
00:24:10,050 --> 00:24:10,940
if you have a problem with me,

326
00:24:10,940 --> 00:24:12,540
you don't have to contact me.

327
00:24:12,770 --> 00:24:14,830
What nonsense are you talking about?

328
00:24:14,980 --> 00:24:16,330
Didn't you invite me out for a meal?

329
00:24:16,330 --> 00:24:17,180
What's wrong?

330
00:24:19,140 --> 00:24:20,700
The noodles you've been showing off
to me lately

331
00:24:20,700 --> 00:24:22,160
are from this shop, right?

332
00:24:22,250 --> 00:24:23,500
Yeah, what's wrong?

333
00:24:24,770 --> 00:24:26,250
You are really something.

334
00:24:26,570 --> 00:24:28,100
What exactly did I do to you?

335
00:24:28,420 --> 00:24:29,460
You even found an inverse function

336
00:24:29,460 --> 00:24:31,460
and brought her right in front of me.

337
00:24:31,570 --> 00:24:33,970
Enjoy the meal with your inverse function.

338
00:24:34,290 --> 00:24:35,090
Tang!

339
00:24:35,140 --> 00:24:36,470
What inverse function?

340
00:25:11,290 --> 00:25:12,220
Didn't coax her?

341
00:25:14,250 --> 00:25:15,740
What's there to coax?

342
00:25:15,900 --> 00:25:17,980
We've been arguing since we were kids.

343
00:25:17,980 --> 00:25:19,240
That's just how she is.

344
00:25:20,460 --> 00:25:22,010
I think in her heart,

345
00:25:22,770 --> 00:25:24,770
she doesn't treat you like a friend.

346
00:25:24,810 --> 00:25:25,900
We really are friends.

347
00:25:25,900 --> 00:25:27,500
We grew up together.

348
00:25:29,380 --> 00:25:30,180
No.

349
00:25:30,980 --> 00:25:32,380
Actually, in your heart,

350
00:25:32,980 --> 00:25:35,240
you don't treat her like a friend either.

351
00:25:41,090 --> 00:25:43,010
Girls need to be coaxed.

352
00:25:43,700 --> 00:25:45,140
If you lose her,

353
00:25:45,610 --> 00:25:47,070
you'll never get her back.

354
00:26:42,750 --> 00:26:48,810
♪ The narcissus rides the carp,
fading away in decay ♪

355
00:26:50,260 --> 00:26:56,360
♪ Dark‑green lurks beneath the sea,
stirring the nebulae ♪

356
00:26:51,290 --> 00:26:55,650
[Lin Zhixia]

357
00:26:52,310 --> 00:26:53,920
Jiang Yubai, I'm almost there.

358
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:54,900
Me too.

359
00:26:55,460 --> 00:26:56,680
There are too many people here.

360
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:57,510
I'm afraid I won't be able to find you.

361
00:26:57,420 --> 00:27:03,920
♪ Through countless nights,
you and I march onward ♪

362
00:26:59,010 --> 00:27:01,350
But I'm trying to move forward.

363
00:27:04,520 --> 00:27:11,060
♪ Probing, waking, and gathering
love gone mad ♪

364
00:27:07,460 --> 00:27:08,440
Then I want to see

365
00:27:08,530 --> 00:27:09,460
how hard you try.

366
00:27:10,530 --> 00:27:11,530
I'm almost there.

367
00:27:11,630 --> 00:27:17,340
♪ Say yes, and let the present reset ♪

368
00:27:14,660 --> 00:27:15,830
I think I see you.

369
00:27:18,650 --> 00:27:21,610
♪ Our first night, my sunset ♪

370
00:27:22,050 --> 00:27:25,290
♪ The whole world, just us two ♪

371
00:27:25,670 --> 00:27:28,850
♪ Sleepless city, rising and falling ♪

372
00:27:29,040 --> 00:27:32,960
♪ Breathing the faint hush of midnight ♪

373
00:27:33,520 --> 00:27:36,010
♪ All around, someone strikes the fire ♪

374
00:27:36,360 --> 00:27:40,040
♪ Lovers burn and wound one another ♪

375
00:27:40,230 --> 00:27:43,000
♪ Viscera and bowels ♪

376
00:27:43,220 --> 00:27:46,720
♪ Through every deep night ♪

377
00:27:46,890 --> 00:27:51,100
♪ Played upon by others ♪

378
00:27:58,450 --> 00:28:02,060
[Wandelong Tavern]

379
00:28:03,330 --> 00:28:05,220
That cafe over there is so pretty.

380
00:28:05,570 --> 00:28:06,420
Yeah.

381
00:28:06,740 --> 00:28:07,540
Very vintage.

382
00:28:11,900 --> 00:28:13,050
Did you collect all the debts today?

383
00:28:13,050 --> 00:28:13,550
Yes, I did.

384
00:28:13,550 --> 00:28:14,420
Tell the brothers

385
00:28:14,420 --> 00:28:15,880
to have a good drink tonight.

386
00:28:15,880 --> 00:28:16,680
Troublesome.

387
00:28:16,740 --> 00:28:17,270
Let's go.

388
00:28:17,570 --> 00:28:18,110
What's wrong?

389
00:28:18,110 --> 00:28:19,420
You guys have worked hard.

390
00:28:19,420 --> 00:28:20,880
Let's eat well—it's on me.

391
00:28:21,090 --> 00:28:22,350
Okay, thank you, Peng.

392
00:28:37,980 --> 00:28:39,750
There was a creditor just now.

393
00:28:40,500 --> 00:28:41,960
I didn't want any trouble.

394
00:28:42,160 --> 00:28:44,240
Was it the one in the black jacket?

395
00:28:42,470 --> 00:28:48,070
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

396
00:28:46,110 --> 00:28:46,790
Yes.

397
00:28:49,580 --> 00:28:55,380
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

398
00:28:49,830 --> 00:28:50,790
He's gone.

399
00:28:52,750 --> 00:28:53,440
Gone?

400
00:28:56,390 --> 00:29:02,170
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

401
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:09,420
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

402
00:29:11,730 --> 00:29:18,130
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

403
00:29:18,800 --> 00:29:24,380
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

404
00:29:25,190 --> 00:29:28,000
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

405
00:29:25,750 --> 00:29:27,280
Your hair is a little messy.

406
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:31,680
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

407
00:29:30,270 --> 00:29:31,070
It's okay.

408
00:29:32,170 --> 00:29:34,360
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

409
00:29:32,430 --> 00:29:33,030
Let's go.

410
00:29:34,800 --> 00:29:38,420
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

411
00:29:39,190 --> 00:29:41,530
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

412
00:29:42,500 --> 00:29:45,230
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

413
00:29:46,020 --> 00:29:48,450
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

414
00:29:49,200 --> 00:29:52,410
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

415
00:29:53,430 --> 00:29:56,220
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

416
00:29:56,970 --> 00:29:59,750
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

417
00:30:00,250 --> 00:30:06,120
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

418
00:30:06,930 --> 00:30:10,060
♪ Myself ♪

419
00:30:38,470 --> 00:30:41,260
♪ Let the wind pass you ♪

420
00:30:41,840 --> 00:30:44,700
♪ Let the dream hug you ♪

421
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:47,570
♪ Let my tears turn into your ♪

422
00:30:47,820 --> 00:30:51,390
♪ Tide sinking into your eyes ♪

423
00:30:52,060 --> 00:30:54,920
♪ As I told you ♪

424
00:30:55,670 --> 00:30:58,520
♪ I'll never respond again ♪

425
00:30:59,070 --> 00:31:01,620
♪ I thought I could ♪

426
00:31:02,100 --> 00:31:05,760
♪ Forget ♪

427
00:31:06,370 --> 00:31:09,320
♪ Listen to the night breeze whispering ♪

428
00:31:10,030 --> 00:31:12,850
♪ It says the rain ceases
and clouds disperse ♪

429
00:31:13,270 --> 00:31:20,670
♪ The rarest blessing in life
is a sweet dream ♪

430
00:31:21,790 --> 00:31:24,570
♪ That never ends ♪

431
00:31:37,750 --> 00:31:39,030
We're pretty busy too,

432
00:31:39,030 --> 00:31:40,880
and you still have to help Tan Qianche?

433
00:31:40,880 --> 00:31:42,640
Then what about our progress?

434
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:45,350
Right. He targeted us so much before.

435
00:31:45,480 --> 00:31:46,960
Why should we help him now?

436
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:54,880
Calm down.

437
00:31:55,440 --> 00:31:56,920
I've done the math on the timing.

438
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:58,450
We should be fine on our end.

439
00:32:08,220 --> 00:32:08,950
Are you busy?

440
00:32:09,380 --> 00:32:10,310
I'm downstairs.

441
00:32:10,350 --> 00:32:11,880
I have something to tell you.

442
00:32:11,880 --> 00:32:12,960
Something came up.

443
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:13,790
I need to go downstairs for a bit.

444
00:32:13,790 --> 00:32:14,850
I'll be right back.

445
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:22,880
If Lin Zhixia wants to help Tan Qianche,

446
00:32:23,310 --> 00:32:24,770
she must have her reasons.

447
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:27,320
She's not that complicated.

448
00:32:27,790 --> 00:32:29,750
She didn't join Tan Qianche's project
back then

449
00:32:29,750 --> 00:32:30,960
because Tan Qianche

450
00:32:30,960 --> 00:32:32,550
didn't need anyone at all.

451
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:34,660
He was forming a small clique.

452
00:32:35,590 --> 00:32:37,390
Now that he is really in trouble,

453
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:39,270
since we are all in the same department,

454
00:32:39,270 --> 00:32:41,470
those who can help should do their part.

455
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:43,440
This isn't personal.

456
00:32:43,440 --> 00:32:44,840
It's for the big picture.

457
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:48,720
Shuwen,

458
00:32:49,310 --> 00:32:50,480
when she didn't vote for you before,

459
00:32:50,480 --> 00:32:51,540
wasn't it the same?

460
00:32:51,950 --> 00:32:53,480
She's objective.

461
00:32:53,880 --> 00:32:56,200
That's how she is different
from Tan Qianche,

462
00:32:56,200 --> 00:32:57,480
and why I chose her.

463
00:32:58,270 --> 00:33:00,350
So we don't need to question her choices.

464
00:33:00,350 --> 00:33:01,880
Just focus on your own work.

465
00:33:15,830 --> 00:33:16,830
Why did you come?

466
00:33:19,510 --> 00:33:20,160
I...

467
00:33:22,030 --> 00:33:23,560
brought you some desserts.

468
00:33:24,270 --> 00:33:26,930
You can have some
when you're tired of studying.

469
00:33:30,440 --> 00:33:31,200
Thank you.

470
00:33:35,310 --> 00:33:36,110
Actually...

471
00:33:37,790 --> 00:33:38,590
I missed you.

472
00:33:39,790 --> 00:33:41,050
I missed you very much,

473
00:33:41,880 --> 00:33:42,960
so I came to see you.

474
00:33:45,680 --> 00:33:46,480
Nothing else.

475
00:33:47,480 --> 00:33:48,270
Go get busy.

476
00:33:57,140 --> 00:33:58,010
You...

477
00:33:58,350 --> 00:33:59,240
Then I'll go up.

478
00:34:03,270 --> 00:34:04,400
I'm really going up.

479
00:34:23,659 --> 00:34:26,190
[Runting] [Time-Customized Wedding]

480
00:34:28,790 --> 00:34:33,449
[Runting] [Time-Customized Wedding]

481
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:35,210
[Inspiration] [Banquet Color]

482
00:34:39,540 --> 00:34:40,880
[Chérie Atelier]

483
00:34:41,320 --> 00:34:43,060
[About Style]

484
00:34:59,650 --> 00:35:02,650
[Watch out for the train]

485
00:35:07,630 --> 00:35:08,830
The door is unlocked.

486
00:35:32,670 --> 00:35:33,600
You've been here

487
00:35:36,230 --> 00:35:37,160
all these years?

488
00:35:39,000 --> 00:35:39,590
Yes.

489
00:35:42,690 --> 00:35:44,690
Although it's your first time here,

490
00:35:45,110 --> 00:35:47,370
I probably don't need to show you around.

491
00:35:48,670 --> 00:35:49,870
After all, you can see

492
00:35:50,550 --> 00:35:52,080
the whole place at a glance.

493
00:35:56,670 --> 00:35:57,400
I came here

494
00:35:58,150 --> 00:35:59,230
to drink with you.

495
00:36:30,030 --> 00:36:31,070
Time flies.

496
00:36:33,030 --> 00:36:33,840
Remember

497
00:36:34,760 --> 00:36:36,620
the first time we drank together?

498
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:39,880
It was at Lin Zhixia's house
during the Spring Festival.

499
00:36:39,880 --> 00:36:41,540
We drank fermented rice wine,

500
00:36:43,590 --> 00:36:45,120
and you actually got drunk.

501
00:36:47,030 --> 00:36:47,800
I remember.

502
00:36:49,630 --> 00:36:52,160
To stop me from staying
at Lin Zhixia's place,

503
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:55,220
you carried me back in the freezing cold.

504
00:36:55,960 --> 00:36:57,760
You have some nerve saying that.

505
00:36:57,880 --> 00:36:59,110
If it weren't for you,

506
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:02,280
who would've slept
on the street on New Year's Eve?

507
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:21,400
Do you know

508
00:37:22,630 --> 00:37:23,550
about Gemini?

509
00:37:27,050 --> 00:37:28,530
It's the most unique one

510
00:37:29,150 --> 00:37:30,810
among the 12 constellations.

511
00:37:31,880 --> 00:37:34,210
Two people guard the starry sky together.

512
00:37:36,510 --> 00:37:39,040
Whenever a crisis breaks out
in the universe,

513
00:37:39,070 --> 00:37:40,870
both of them want to step forward

514
00:37:41,230 --> 00:37:42,560
to guard this universe.

515
00:37:47,230 --> 00:37:48,630
But the tragedy is that

516
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:53,200
they belong to the same constellation.

517
00:37:54,400 --> 00:37:56,730
Only one person can wear the sacred cloth.

518
00:37:59,400 --> 00:38:00,530
And the other person

519
00:38:02,920 --> 00:38:04,920
is destined to hide behind forever.

520
00:38:09,190 --> 00:38:12,320
It's precisely because the Gemini brothers
sympathize with

521
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:13,720
and encourage each other

522
00:38:14,590 --> 00:38:15,550
that they can become

523
00:38:15,550 --> 00:38:17,810
the strongest warriors in the universe.

524
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:22,690
Jiang Yubai.

525
00:38:26,630 --> 00:38:27,800
I like Lin Zhixia.

526
00:38:32,150 --> 00:38:32,960
I know.

527
00:38:35,670 --> 00:38:36,480
From the past

528
00:38:37,760 --> 00:38:38,620
to the present.

529
00:38:41,030 --> 00:38:41,840
I'll probably

530
00:38:43,880 --> 00:38:45,150
like her forever.

531
00:38:53,880 --> 00:38:56,340
But you're the one
wearing the sacred cloth.

532
00:38:59,480 --> 00:39:01,740
I hope you can guard this starry sky well.

533
00:39:03,960 --> 00:39:04,760
In this world,

534
00:39:06,230 --> 00:39:08,430
no one understands her better than you,

535
00:39:09,670 --> 00:39:12,000
and no one can protect her
better than you.

536
00:39:16,030 --> 00:39:17,090
Congratulations.

537
00:39:20,190 --> 00:39:22,120
I sincerely wish you both the best.

538
00:39:45,190 --> 00:39:45,690
So,

539
00:39:47,190 --> 00:39:48,390
you asked me out today

540
00:39:49,280 --> 00:39:50,440
to tell me this?

541
00:39:51,960 --> 00:39:52,840
Of course not.

542
00:39:56,280 --> 00:39:56,960
I came here

543
00:39:57,920 --> 00:39:59,520
to drink you under the table.

544
00:42:04,150 --> 00:42:05,340
When I touched him,

545
00:42:06,210 --> 00:42:09,130
my fingers felt a tiny static shock.

546
00:42:10,860 --> 00:42:12,660
My heartbeat sped up instantly.

547
00:42:13,630 --> 00:42:14,920
I thought I was sick.

548
00:42:16,800 --> 00:42:20,170
Only when the box is opened,

549
00:42:21,150 --> 00:42:24,010
will the state of Schrödinger's cat
be determined.

550
00:42:25,440 --> 00:42:27,070
But right now, I'm very sure

551
00:42:27,980 --> 00:42:29,640
that Schrödinger's sickness

552
00:42:30,320 --> 00:42:31,590
is all Jiang Yubai's fault.
